# Echo Framework

## Description

Echo is a high-performance, minimalist web framework for Go. Features fast routing, middleware support, data binding, and template rendering.

## When to Use

- Building REST APIs with Go
- High-performance web applications
- Applications requiring clean API
- Microservices architecture

---

